{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_9_level_st_09-02",
  "groupId": "main_9",
  "stageId": "st_09-02",
  "title": "灰燼中的詩",
  "storyCode": "9-8",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_09-02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "354bc08351e8ca2fcaa1ecbbff791edebb98062283b1a5adf5aa14a9c3f834b3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G3_victoria_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領袖，人找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，帶上來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹什麼！你、你放開我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你把聚會的消息傳給維多利亞軍的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？你怎麼知......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下，你、你是......你是那個人？！你就是總編他們說的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟他們說的那樣，你會帶來一場戰爭，領著我們趕走壓迫者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......你會帶來死亡......把我們的家園化作廢墟，就像現在這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切的源頭，都是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我將帶來的只有勝利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你，西爾莎·凱利，你深深傷害了我們的同胞對你的信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "許多志士險些因你的出賣而落入敵人的囹圄，無數戰士可能因你的背叛而無緣見到勝利的榮光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你必須為你的行為付出代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們......真的是因為我做的事而死的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天晚上，聚在那邊屋子裡的人，他們中的很大一部分是真心想迎接你，他們相信你可以給我們帶來好的變化！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而現在，他們和這條街一樣被炸成了焦土。放這把火的人，難道是我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴，叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這軟弱的投敵者，如何能理解烈士的決心？與其落入敵手，遭受羞辱和折磨，他們寧願昂首迎接領袖的火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們是為了塔拉人的福祉，不得不在戰火中犧牲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宣判吧，領袖，判她死刑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......死刑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。你沒看見嗎？只有叛徒的死才能平息戰士們的怒火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外——你看看周圍的當地人。他們想走近，又不敢。他們在恐懼我們，恐懼你。這正是讓他們徹底臣服的好機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你處死這個叛徒，他們就能學會，沒人能在背叛深池之後活下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒人能......背叛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西爾莎·凱利，你有想過背叛的後果嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......也許，我會死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不後悔。既然你會因為我想救我的家人朋友而殺了我，那只能說明我做得對——要是沒人阻止的話，還會有更多人因你而死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你很有勇氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒聽錯吧，你誇一個叛徒有勇氣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她也是我們的同胞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從她選擇擋路開始，她就不再是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，囉嗦這些有意義嗎？如果是她，根本就不會問這麼多。一個註定要死的人說的話，不應該對你產生影響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如果是姐姐的話......她會怎麼做？\n他們都在這麼問。\n可是......我不喜歡這麼想。我從來都，不喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快點動手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼多雙眼睛盯著呢。你拖得越久，就越顯得我們懦弱。誰願意跟隨一個懦弱的領袖？人民又怎麼會追隨一支懦弱的隊伍？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她沒給我選擇。\n這個孩子，不是我殺死的第一個同胞。那時候我才幾歲？她讓我燒死那個不願意賣麵包給我們的維多利亞商人。\n我忘了我是怎麼做的。我閉上眼舉起了小刀，可只是扎進了一堆焦臭的灰燼裡。\n後來，灰越來越多。和這個孩子一樣，越有勇氣的人，他們燒得越快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......西爾莎·凱利。我以深池領袖的名義，判處你死刑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會在這裡親手處決你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來......我還是要死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......領袖。你是領袖，可能沒人能阻止你，我的家人們都還是會死。但你能不能告訴我，我們會勝利嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會有那麼一天，我們塔拉人都能過上更好的生活？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那就好，至少在這一刻，我願意......相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還有什麼話要說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火......我看到了你槍尖的火。被燒死的時候會不會很痛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，還是別告訴我，我不敢聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求你，告訴我的爸爸媽媽，如果事情結束之後他們還能活著的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我瞞著他們，在床頭第三個櫃子裡藏了一些錢，我想在下個月媽媽生日的時候給她買一束花......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴他們，我對不起大家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我答應你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......我不想死。我好害怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西爾莎",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......哈......不知道明年春天，在燒焦了的土地上，柳樹還會不會發芽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了......深池！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這句話......我說了無數次。\n每說一次，我的胸腹都在灼痛中翻攪，就彷彿槍不在我的手上，而是正扎在我的體內。\n我一遍遍地告訴自己，生命易燃，他們都是燃料。\n......我也不例外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈，死了。這還差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳令下去，讓其他人都知道，叛徒已被處決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再有人想告密，就等著跟她一樣碎成炭渣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，長官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於你，你今天到底怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼磨蹭，戰士們看到了，還以為他們的領袖會對叛徒心軟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你該不會真心軟了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是一個人，你昨天那一把火可是乾脆地燒掉了大半條街！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為你終於像點樣子了呢，“領袖”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我像樣子嗎？\n像什麼樣子？我很久沒注意到自己是什麼樣子了。\n從小時候開始，我眼裡就只有她的樣貌，她的語氣，她的火。\n她要我也變成這樣。我做不到，所以我註定只能藏在她的火光之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她又在發呆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次看到她擺出這副表情，我就想衝她的臉尖叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嫉妒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少來刺我。我就是看不順眼她頂著這張臉，腦子裡卻全是廢水做的肥皂泡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼領袖要把她擺在這個位置上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是那張天生的面孔，她不過是個廢物，連處決一個叛徒都做不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你代她做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她自己都搞不清楚，但我看得挺明白，她的火燒到之前，那女孩就已經被看不見的石錐刺穿了胸膛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我實在忍不住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是因為這個無恥的叛徒，我好不容易召集來這麼多有錢有勢的支持者，結果死的死，散的散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？沒想到你還有一點憐憫之心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......就算是一群肉獸，也該發揮點作用再去死吧？現在倒好，砰一下，全都成了焦炭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼乾脆地死了說不定是好事。別忘了，你那點貪心的小計畫，可差一點把我們都坑了進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我是為了領袖和深池！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你不覺得她不配？哪怕她沒有帶人過來，我也能把小丘郡管好。不，是更好。我能做得更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是領袖能更信任我一些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不配？你說的倒是沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人啊，最好還是能看清楚些，別整天想著爬到不屬於自己的位置，否則的話，一個不小心就會跌下來，啪，粉身碎骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是在罵我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，別瞪著她生悶氣了。我們還要商量下一步該怎麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“強盜”、“縱火者”、“會計”、“毒藥學者”、“囚犯”，還有“雄辯家”。昨天晚上發出的通知，算算時間，他們都該到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在市政廳是我們的了，要員和貴族我們也控制了不少。但還不夠。我們得在領袖到這裡之前，把小丘郡徹底佔領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再咬的話，你的指甲就該禿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要你管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到時候別哭著求我再幫你塗個新的花樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我什麼時候在你面前哭過？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我就是不想把功勞拱手讓人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦好啦，我還不知道你？你是最早跟隨領袖的人之一，眼光也該放長遠些。不過一個小丘郡，就讓你心癢成這樣，你也不嫌丟人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿赫茉妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_228_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等這裡的事辦完，領袖需要有人替她跑一趟倫蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不早說！快，趕緊走，我要在半天之內拿下小丘郡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他們每個人心裡都有自己的欲望，光怪陸離，就連最烈的火都沒法一把燒得見底。\n那我的呢？我只想，躲起來......\n可是，影子能有逃開的權利嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "21_G3_victoria_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿赫茉妮女士請您去開會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......一定要去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，女士確實說了，要是您實在不想去，他們也會尊重您的意願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尊重......？她說得真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "士兵，你去告訴他們，一切按計畫進行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們知道自己的職責，不需要我來敦促。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於我，我需要安靜地思考。命令你的人好好守著，不要讓人來打擾我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要......一點時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“領袖”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_231",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是......什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我在廢墟裡撿到了一張紙。\n紙張十分脆弱，四角都已焦黑，一拿起來，半邊就化成了灰，紙上的文字也只可悲地剩下了一半。\n“我何須灰心”\n“雖然大火燃盡了整片大地”\n“可我看到一個人的靈魂，在磅秤的另一端”\n是一首詩，一首缺失開頭的詩。\n這些字句看起來是剛剛寫就，墨水還沒有自然凝固，就已被火焚乾。\n是的，我的火。\n我的靈魂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
